      "text": "Noah … planted a vineyard, Gen. 9:20. thou shalt not glean thy vineyard, Lev. 19:10. When thou comest into thy neighbour’s vineyard, Deut. 23:24. Samson … came to the vineyards of Timnath, Judg. 14:5. Ahab spake unto Naboth, saying, Give me thy vineyard, 1 Kgs. 21:2. vineyard which thy right hand hath planted, Ps. 80:15. vineyard of the man void of understanding, Prov. 24:30. mine own vineyard have I not kept, Song 1:6. song of my beloved touching his vineyard, Isa. 5:1. that day sing ye unto her, A vineyard of red wine, Isa. 27:2. they shall plant vineyards, Isa. 65:21. they shall plant vineyards, Amos 9:14.",
